#: docs/design/multiple-dma-controllers.md:14
msgid ""
"Reviewed silicon AFs are USART2 PA2/PA3 AF7, USART1 PA9/PA10 AF7, SPI2 "
"PB13/PB14/PB15 AF5, and SPI1 PA5/PA6/PA7 AF5. These facts do not supply "
"external Board wiring, connectors, electrical pull-ups or qualification. "
"Typed configuration remains the single assembly authority. The second UART TX"
" conflicts with the first I2C TX engine and must be rejected in resource "
"resolution."
msgstr ""
"经审阅的芯片 AF 为 USART2 PA2/PA3 AF7、USART1 PA9/PA10 AF7、SPI2 PB13/PB14/PB15 AF5 和 "
"SPI1 PA5/PA6/PA7 AF5。这些事实不提供外部 Board 接线、连接器、电气上拉或资格。类型化配置仍是唯一装配权威。第二个 UART TX"
" 与第一个 I2C TX 引擎冲突，必须在资源解析时拒绝。"

#: docs/design/multiple-dma-controllers.md:21
msgid ""
"STM UART initialization uses retained exact IRQ, DMA, stream and clock facts."
" STM SPI initialization validates the selected bus, clock and engine "
"pointers; an idle bus whose DMA vectors remain enabled cannot be acquired by "
"another cold object. Existing primary initializers remain thin wrappers. "
"Duplicate/live hardware, retained enabled DMA publishers and unsupported "
"tuples reject before effects. A disabled engine still has an owner while its "
"vector lease is enabled; cold acquisition preserves that owner's "
"flags/priority."
msgstr ""
"STM UART 初始化使用保留的精确 IRQ、DMA、stream 与时钟事实。STM SPI 初始化验证所选总线、时钟和引擎指针；总线即便空闲，只要其"
" DMA 向量仍启用，另一冷态对象就不能取得它。已有主初始化函数仍是薄包装层。重复或活动硬件、仍启用的 DMA "
"发布者及未支持的元组，均在产生效果前拒绝。引擎即使已禁用，只要其向量租约仍启用，所有者仍然存在；冷态取得保留该所有者的标志和优先级。"

#: docs/design/multiple-dma-controllers.md:28
msgid ""
"Finite DMA completion is independent from wire completion. Hot W1C clears "
"only observed completion/half-completion bits; fresh error bits remain "
"latched. The provider reads errors after actual engine withdrawal and again "
"before settlement. It never reports success after a detected DMA error. Both "
"engines, IRQ sources and SPI wire must drain before CS release and SETTLED; "
"UART also requires true TC. Failed withdrawal retains QUARANTINED requests "
"and buffers. Peer flags, clocks, vectors, CS and loans remain independent. "
"Shared DMA clock ownership belongs to outer assembly and is never released by"
" an individual stop."
msgstr ""
"有限 DMA 完成独立于线侧完成。热路径 W1C 只清除已观察完成／半完成位，保留新错误位锁存。提供者在实际引擎撤销后及最终完成发布前再次读取错误，检测到"
" DMA 错误后绝不报告成功。SPI 释放 CS 与发布 SETTLED 前必须排空两个引擎、IRQ 源与线侧；UART 还需真实 TC。撤销失败保留 "
"QUARANTINED 请求与缓冲区。对等实例的标志、时钟、向量、CS 与借用相互独立。共享 DMA 时钟归外层装配所有，单实例停止不释放它。"

#: docs/design/multiple-dma-controllers.md:37
msgid ""
"Explicit SPI fixed-memory flags preserve caller-owned dummy/discard scalar "
"storage, exact one-byte DMA domains and MINC identity. There is no implicit "
"scratch fallback. STM SPI2 polling abort/recovery pulses APB1 SPI2 reset; it "
"does not reset the neighboring APB2 SPI1 controller."
msgstr ""
"显式 SPI 固定内存标志保留调用方持有的 dummy/discard 标量存储、精确单字节 DMA 域及 MINC 身份；没有隐式临时存储回退。STM "
"SPI2 轮询中止／恢复只脉冲 APB1 SPI2 复位，不复位邻近 APB2 SPI1 控制器。"

