msgid ""
"After memory and publisher drain, close withdraws ADC resources and then the"
" selected timer gate. A refused gate release retains the TIMER receipt and "
"its original identity even after the ADC clock is gone. Rebind stays BUSY; "
"retry releases only the retained timer. A failed gate enable records that "
"identity before the write. Startup and cleanup remain serialized privileged "
"task work, with no scheduler, allocation or hidden sampling task."
msgstr ""
"内存与 publisher 排空后，close 先撤回 ADC 资源，再撤回所选 timer gate。gate 释放被拒时，即使 ADC clock "
"已关闭，也保留 TIMER 收条及其原始身份。重新绑定仍返回 BUSY；重试只释放被保留的 timer。gate "
"启用失败前同样先记录身份。启动与清理仍由串行的特权 task 执行，不建立 scheduler、分配器或隐式采样任务。"

