msgid ""
"The VE/baremetal and ZG/FreeRTOS `*adc-timers*.toml` references select all "
"three converters with three independent timers. Model tests execute real "
"finite and continuous C paths, including invalid sources and refused "
"acquisition/release. ARM linking, source SDK consumption and physical "
"acquisition are separate checks; physical edge rate, jitter and analog "
"behavior require an actual board."
msgstr ""
"VE／裸机与 ZG／FreeRTOS 的 `*adc-timers*.toml` 参考选择三个转换器和三个独立 timer。模型测试执行真实有限与连续 "
"C 路径，覆盖非法源及取得／释放被拒。ARM 链接、Source SDK 消费和物理采集分别验证；实际边沿速率、抖动与模拟行为需要实板。"

msgid ""
"The immutable typed option drives the resource claims, preflight clock mask,"
" trigger graph and generated C selector. Analog Board routes authorize only "
"the selected ADC pins; they no longer contain a fixed TIM3 policy. One "
"shared read-only C fact table owns EXTSEL, controller, APB gate and channel "
"identities. The mutable selector uses existing padding. Public ADC faces and"
" stream buffer contracts remain unchanged. See the [I/O ownership "
"diagrams](io-evolution.md) for the producer loan and withdrawal boundary."
msgstr ""
"不可变 typed option 驱动 resource claim、preflight clock mask、trigger graph 和生成的 C"
" selector。模拟 Board route 只授权所选 ADC 引脚，不再承载固定 TIM3 政策。一张共享只读 C 事实表维护 "
"EXTSEL、controller、APB gate 和 channel 身份。可变 selector 使用原有 padding。公共 ADC face"
" 和 stream buffer 合同保持原样。producer 借用与撤回边界见 [I/O 所有权框图](io-evolution.md)。"

msgid ""
"The optional TOML `trigger` defaults to `tim3-trgo`. Three ADCs may run "
"independently with distinct timer owners; this is not simultaneous or "
"interleaved multimode conversion. Each selection exclusively claims the "
"entire timer, conflicting with its PWM, capture, encoder or another ADC "
"owner. TIM2 remains the Core monotonic clock. EXTI11 needs a separate "
"physical pin/event owner and is not admitted through these internal routes."
msgstr ""
"TOML 可选项 `trigger` 默认为 `tim3-trgo`。三个 ADC 在 timer owner 各自独立时可独立运行；这不代表同步或交错"
" multimode 转换。每个选择独占整个 timer，与其 PWM、capture、encoder 或其他 ADC owner 互斥。TIM2 "
"保留给 Core 单调时钟。EXTI11 需要独立的物理 pin／event owner，不由这些内部路线接入。"

msgid ""
"The shared C timer program clears inherited slave, output, interrupt, repeat"
" and compare policy before arming. No timer pad or vector is acquired. TRGO "
"uses update; compare events occur at ARR with CCxE disabled. Initial compare"
" phase differs from the first update, so neither choice promises PWM phase "
"or an aperture timestamp. UG occurs while ADC external detection is "
"disabled; after ADC warmup, external detection and the selected counter are "
"enabled. The full scan budget still uses 21 MHz ADCCLK and the actual "
"selected resolution/sample codes."
msgstr ""
"共享 C timer program 在 arm 前清理继承的 slave、output、interrupt、repeat 和 compare "
"政策，不取得 timer pad 或 vector。TRGO 使用 update；compare 事件在 ARR 发生，CCxE 保持关闭。首次 "
"compare 相位不同于首次 update，因此均不承诺 PWM 相位或采样孔径时间戳。UG 发生在 ADC external detection "
"关闭时；ADC warmup 后才启用外部检测与所选 counter。完整 scan 预算仍使用 21 MHz ADCCLK 和实际分辨率／sample"
" code。"

msgid ""
"The table describes finite UART TX/SPI DMA paths. Receive modes and "
"additional controllers have their own selected contracts in the support "
"matrix; a TX route does not itself authorize RX. Actual "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock MMIO regressions and strict ARM SDK object/layout "
"reports are development evidence. Factory/selected whole-image validation is"
" recorded separately. Physical DMA, IRQ latency, CS/wire timing and Board "
"HIL remain **not executed**."
msgstr ""
"表中描述有限 UART TX／SPI DMA 路径。接收模式与其他控制器在支持矩阵中有各自的 selected contract；TX 路线本身不授权 "
"RX。实际 GoogleTest／GoogleMock MMIO 回归与严格 ARM SDK object／layout "
"报告是开发证据，factory／selected 整镜像验证另行记录。物理 DMA、IRQ 延迟、CS／wire 时序与 Board HIL "
"仍为**未执行**。"

msgid "Timer"
msgstr "Timer"
